~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Special Containment Procedures:  SCP-XXXX-1 is to be kept in a locker at Site-19. Requests to use SCP-XXXX-1 for testing purposes only  must be accepted / denied by personnel with a Level 4 Clearance or higher. Any object made by SCP-XXXX-3 should be incinerated if possible
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Description:  SCP-XXXX-1 is a brown doll. On SCP-XXXX-1 is purple clothing, a golden harness and a black mask with feathers on top of it. The exact details of the clothing and mask vary slightly between different people. When SCP-XXXX-1 comes in contact with human skin or blood, SCP-XXXX-2 manifests next to SCP-XXXX’s mask. SCP-XXXX-2 is a pill, similar in appearance to 1. When SCP-XXXX-3 touches a physical object, it usually turns into a different material however there are cases where the material disappears entirely.
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

